/-- p06014 — 6:B7. $\Wt J=J\Wt$, hence $\Ft J=J\Ft$; $\Vt=V^{+}\oplus V^{-}$ with $\dim V^{+}=2\kap+1$, $\dim V^{-}=2\kap-1$. -/
